	(text "CMS-010 | SDRAM power and bypass\nVDD and VDDQ share +3V3_MCU (3.0 to 3.6 V).\nC76-C79: 4 x 100 nF for the four VDD pins.\nC80-C87: 8 x 100 nF for the eight VDDQ pins.\nC88: 10 uF local bulk; Cnom = 12 x 0.1 + 10 = 11.2 uF.\nIncluded in the PWR-003 1 mF whole-rail limit.\nEffective C, placement and PDN impedance require qualification."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/camera_storage_interfaces.md#cms-010-is42s32160f-7tli-pin-and-electrical-contract")
		)
		(uuid "3dfe9a7d-05b9-43c6-b336-a2b76637c897")
	)
	(text "CMS-010 | Pull load and power states\nSink leakage: 5uA SDRAM+1uA board=6uA.\nIsink=3.6/9801+6uA=0.373309mA (<0.374mA).\nPmax=3.6^2/9801=1.322314mW per pull.\nAll ten LOW: 10*3.6/9801=3.673095mA rail;\n10*3.6^2/9801=13.223140mW resistor heat.\nReserve 4mA within the 250mA SDRAM allocation.\nCKE/DQM and CS_N default HIGH; CLK HIGH is not a clock.\nSwitched-rail pulls; self-refresh actively holds CKE LOW.\nStartup, dynamic I/O, SI and shutdown qualification OPEN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.446 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/camera_storage_interfaces.md#cms-010-is42s32160f-7tli-pin-and-electrical-contract")
		)
		(uuid "47df23ed-e7e5-4c56-9ffa-338aec18de44")
	)
	(text "CMS-010 | R44-R53: 10k reset defaults\nRail 3.0..3.6V; +/-1%, 100ppm/C, |dT|<=100C.\nRmin=10k*0.99*0.99=9801 ohm.\nRmax=10k*1.01*1.01=10201 ohm.\nIoff=5uA SDRAM+1uA MCU+1uA board=7uA.\nVHIGHmin=3.0-7uA*10201=2.928593V (>2.0V VIH).\nBoard leakage and temperature screen require qualification."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 152.146 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
			(href "https://github.com/bsikar/ra8-firmware/blob/design/ereader-circuit/ra8p1_kicad/design/camera_storage_interfaces.md#cms-010-is42s32160f-7tli-pin-and-electrical-contract")
		)
		(uuid "5e5b0bd4-c7e4-4068-83f4-db1d46ee8941")
	)
	(text "64 MiB SDRAM | ISSI IS42S32160F-7TLI\nSignal and reset-default circuits | CMS-010.\nStartup, SI/timing and hardware qualification remain open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c56fb1b6-e500-48a9-9717-4018b973208c")
	)
